      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Public worlds that also have OnEnterTrigger related bugs:\nVRHat - wrld_3fae8b92-0cdc-4e76-8a6d-f0daf09a5ff4\nLakuza Lounge - wrld_81df7889-a3af-40f5-bcca-4bf0d447b225\nPressing 'e' will not pickup desktop props using OnEnterTrigger. Make sure props are away from initial area.\nMeat Grinder - wrld_c6b6c1fa-ed05-46eb-a148-38655c64b8e4\nObjects do not enter trigger and destroy\nWhat a Legend - wrld_2975477a-ce90-47b7-9828-c1ee5f28c362\nEntering orange portal to the right will not allow you to exit. OnEnterTrigger on player local. Also the torch does not light other torches.",
